Description
===========


"Computes the $i$-th cohomology of the toric vector bundle $E$ for a given list
of degrees. For this $i$ must be between $0$ and the rank of the vector bundle.
The entries of the list "L must be one column matrices each defining a point in
the lattice of the fan over which $E$ is defined
+----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : E = tangentBundle hirzebruchFan 3        |
|                                              |
|o1 = {dimension of the variety => 2 }         |
|      number of affine charts => 4            |
|      number of rays => 4                     |
|      rank of the vector bundle => 2          |
|                                              |
|o1 : ToricVectorBundleKlyachko                |
+----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : HH_0^E {matrix{{1},{0}},matrix{{-1},{0}}}|
|                                              |
|            1        1                        |
|o2 = {(QQ[]) , (QQ[]) }                       |
|                                              |
|o2 : List                                     |
+----------------------------------------------+

