    bundle in Klyachko's description
  * *note addFiltration: addFiltration, -- changing the filtration matrices of
    a toric vector bundle in Klyachko's description
  * *note cocycleCheck: cocycleCheck, --  checks if a toric vector bundle
    fulfills the cocycle condition
  * *note regCheck: regCheck, --  checking the regularity condition for a toric
    vector bundle
  * *note addBaseChange: addBaseChange, -- changing the transition matrices of
