ToricVectorBundle -- the class of all toric vector bundles
**********************************************************

Description
===========

In *note ToricVectorBundles: Top, an equivariant vector bundle on some toric
variety is given as an object of class ToricVectorBundle which can be given in
two descriptions:
  * By a collection of vector spaces with filtration for each ray of the
    underlying fan, *note ToricVectorBundleKlyachko:
    ToricVectorBundleKlyachko,.
  * By a set of degree vectors for each maximal cone and a transition matrix
    for each pair of maximal cones of the underlying fan, *note
    ToricVectorBundleKaneyama: ToricVectorBundleKaneyama,.


For more detailed descriptions see the corresponding pages of the two subtypes.

See also
========

  * *note ToricVectorBundleKlyachko: ToricVectorBundleKlyachko, -- the class of
    all toric vector bundles in Klyachko's description
  * *note ToricVectorBundleKaneyama: ToricVectorBundleKaneyama, -- the class of
    all toric vector bundles in Kaneyama's description

Types of ToricVectorBundle:
===========================

  * *note ToricVectorBundleKaneyama: ToricVectorBundleKaneyama, -- the class of
    all toric vector bundles in Kaneyama's description
  * *note ToricVectorBundleKlyachko: ToricVectorBundleKlyachko, -- the class of
    all toric vector bundles in Klyachko's description

Functions and methods returning an object of class ToricVectorBundle:
=====================================================================

  * *note exteriorPower(ZZ,ToricVectorBundle):
    exteriorPower_lpZZ_cmToricVectorBundle_rp, --  the 'l'-th exterior power of
    a toric vector bundle
  * *note tensor(ToricVectorBundle,ToricVectorBundle):
    tensor_lpToricVectorBundle_cmToricVectorBundle_rp, --  the tensor product
    of two toric vector bundles

Methods that use an object of class ToricVectorBundle:
======================================================

  * "charts(ToricVectorBundle)" -- see *note charts: charts, --  the number of
    maximal affine charts
  * "deltaE(ToricVectorBundle)" -- see *note deltaE: deltaE, --  the polytope
    of possible degrees that give non zero cohomology
  * "details(ToricVectorBundle)" -- see *note details: details, --  the details
    of a toric vector bundle
