in the order they appear in maxCones F. The number of matrices in L2 must match
the number of pairs of maximal cones that intersect in a common codimension-one
face and must all be in GL(k,*note QQ: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,). They will be
assigned to the pairs $(i,j)$ in lexicographic order.


